# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Restart Chapter, slot 2 (the list opens on slot 1): the world map, Chapter 2 to its first player phase (suspend saves made from slot 2's game save).
# 4800 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu
000*98
080*2      # 1400: Down, Restart Chapter
000*98
001*2      # 1500: A: the slot list (on slot 1)
000*148
080*2      # 1650: Down, slot 2
000*198
001*2      # 1850: A, slot 2: 'Suspended data will be lost'
000*148
020*2      # 2000: Left, Start
000*98
001*2      # 2100: A, confirm
000*598
200*2      # 2700: L, world map: the cursor to Ide
000*198
001*2      # 2900: A, start Chapter 2
000*398
008*2      # 3300: Start, skip
000*798
008*2      # 4100: Start, skip
000*698
